## Composition edge cases

Interactions BETWEEN atomics — never atomic-internal cases (those live in the atomic's design.md).

| Case | Handling |
|---|---|
| Primary action loading; user clicks cancel | <define: cancel button still works because `state_propagation` only sets `disabled` on cancel when both are loading + saving> |
| Composite opens during parent form submit | <define: form interaction disabled while composite is open> |
| Body content very long | <define: composite body scrolls; action row stays sticky> |
| Trigger element unmounted while composite open | <define: focus return falls back to document body> |
| Very narrow viewport | <define: composite resizes / stacks actions vertically> |

